---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> BIBLIOTECA ABERTA · GITHUB COMO FONTE</div>
        <h1>Aprenda a pensar<br /><span class="gold-text">segurança</span> com clareza.</h1>
        <p>Uma jornada de livros, aulas e exercícios de cibersegurança para pessoas e inteligências artificiais. Escolha seu caminho, estude sem cadastro e consulte sempre a fonte pública.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button gold" href="#comece">Começar a estudar <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/for-ai/">Conectar uma IA <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
        <div class="hero-metrics"><div><strong>207</strong><span>cursos no mapa</span></div><div><strong>23</strong><span>áreas de estudo</span></div><div><strong>9</strong><span>níveis de formação</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Ilustração abstrata das trilhas de aprendizagem">
        <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="orbit orbit-three"></div>
        <div class="central-disc"><div class="disc-grid"></div><span>CyKin</span><small>knowledge network</small></div>
        <div class="floating-tag tag-one"><span class="tag-icon">◈</span><div><strong>Conhecimento</strong><small>técnico, aberto</small></div></div>
        <div class="floating-tag tag-two"><span class="tag-icon">✦</span><div><strong>Uma aula por capítulo</strong><small>com exercícios</small></div></div>
        <div class="floating-tag tag-three"><span class="tag-icon">↗</span><div><strong>Fonte viva</strong><small>sincronizada ao GitHub</small></div></div>
        <span class="orbit-point p1"></span><span class="orbit-point p2"></span><span class="orbit-point p3"></span><span class="orbit-point p4"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section start-section" id="comece">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">COMECE POR AQUI</div><h2>Duas formas de chegar à aula certa.</h2><p>Você escolhe a ordem. Em ambas as trilhas, o guia mostra as matérias do curso do início ao fim e abre somente as aulas já escritas.</p></div>
      <div class="routes">
        <form id="route-theme" class="route-card card">
          <div class="route-top"><span class="route-number">01</span><span class="route-shape">◈</span></div>
          <h3>Tenho um tema em mente</h3>
          <p>Escolha idioma, tema e nível. Abra o curso completo e siga as aulas em sequência.</p>
          <div class="route-steps"><span>Idioma</span><span>→</span><span>Tema</span><span>→</span><span>Nível</span></div>
          <div class="route-fields"><div class="field"><label for="language-theme">1. Idioma</label><select id="language-theme" required><option value="en">English</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="es">Español</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="area-theme">2. Tema</label><select id="area-theme" required></select></div><div class="field"><label for="level-theme">3. Nível</label><select id="level-theme" required></select></div></div>
          <button class="button route-button" type="submit">Abrir o curso <span>↗</span></button>
        </form>
        <form id="route-level" class="route-card card">
          <div class="route-top"><span class="route-number">02</span><span class="route-shape">▤</span></div>
          <h3>Quero estudar um nível inteiro</h3>
          <p>Escolha idioma e nível. Veja os 23 temas daquele nível na ordem curricular, com seus guias de aula.</p>
          <div class="route-steps"><span>Idioma</span><span>→</span><span>Nível</span><span>→</span><span>23 temas</span></div>
          <div class="route-fields"><div class="field"><label for="language-level">1. Idioma</label><select id="language-level" required><option value="en">English</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="es">Español</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="level-level">2. Nível</label><select id="level-level" required></select></div><div class="route-note">Você poderá avançar do primeiro ao último tema, aula por aula, sem perder a referência do livro.</div></div>
          <button class="button secondary route-button" type="submit">Ver todos os temas <span>↗</span></button>
        </form>
      </div>
      <p id="catalog-status" class="catalog-status" role="status">Carregando o catálogo público…</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section philosophy">
    <div class="shell philosophy-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">DO CONCEITO À PRÁTICA</div><h2>Aprendizado que você consegue verificar.</h2><p class="muted">Cada matéria é um capítulo do livro do curso. A página da aula reúne explicações, exemplos, exercícios e respostas trabalhadas, com links para o capítulo anterior, índice e próximo.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/hiagokinlevi/CyKin/blob/main/BOOK_STANDARD.md">Conheça o padrão editorial →</a></div><div class="principles"><div><span>01</span><div><strong>Fonte transparente</strong><p>Texto aberto no GitHub, com caminho e edição identificados.</p></div></div><div><span>02</span><div><strong>Sem barreira de entrada</strong><p>Leitura de cursos, livros e exercícios sem conta.</p></div></div><div><span>03</span><div><strong>Pronto para outras IAs</strong><p>API pública, Markdown direto e servidor MCP somente leitura.</p></div></div></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section ai-strip"><div class="shell ai-inner"><div><div class="eyebrow">PARA SISTEMAS E AGENTES</div><h2>Um acervo que outras IAs podem consultar.</h2><p>ChatGPT, Claude, DAI e outras ferramentas podem descobrir cursos e ler aulas pelo endpoint MCP ou pela API aberta. Cada resposta aponta para o manuscrito no GitHub.</p></div><a class="button gold" href="/for-ai/">Ver conexão MCP →</a></div></section>
  <script>
    type Course = { level: string; area: string; title: string; number: number };
    type Catalog = { courses: Course[]; level_order: string[]; level_names: Record<string, Record<string,string>> };
    const status = document.getElementById('catalog-status')!;
    const fill = (id: string, options: [string,string][]) => {
      const element = document.getElementById(id) as HTMLSelectElement;
      element.replaceChildren(...options.map(([value,label]) => { const opt = document.createElement('option'); opt.value=value; opt.textContent=label; return opt; }));
    };
    try {
      const response = await fetch('/api/catalog');
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error('catálogo indisponível');
      const data = await response.json() as Catalog;
      const areas = data.courses.filter(c => c.level === data.level_order[0]).map(c => [c.area, c.title] as [string,string]);
      fill('area-theme', areas);
      const setLevels = (select: string, lang: string) => fill(select, data.level_order.map(key => [key, data.level_names[key][lang]]));
      setLevels('level-theme', 'en'); setLevels('level-level', 'en');
      document.getElementById('language-theme')?.addEventListener('change', event => setLevels('level-theme', (event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value));
      document.getElementById('language-level')?.addEventListener('change', event => setLevels('level-level', (event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value));
      status.textContent = 'Catálogo carregado. O conteúdo de cada aula é lido do GitHub no momento do acesso.';
      (document.getElementById('route-theme') as HTMLFormElement).addEventListener('submit', event => {
        event.preventDefault();
        const q = new URLSearchParams({mode:'theme',lang:(document.getElementById('language-theme') as HTMLSelectElement).value,area:(document.getElementById('area-theme') as HTMLSelectElement).value,level:(document.getElementById('level-theme') as HTMLSelectElement).value});
        location.href='/learn/?'+q;
      });
      (document.getElementById('route-level') as HTMLFormElement).addEventListener('submit', event => {
        event.preventDefault();
        const q = new URLSearchParams({mode:'level',lang:(document.getElementById('language-level') as HTMLSelectElement).value,level:(document.getElementById('level-level') as HTMLSelectElement).value});
        location.href='/learn/?'+q;
      });
    } catch {
      status.innerHTML = 'O catálogo do site está temporariamente indisponível. <a href="https://github.com/hiagokinlevi/CyKin">Leia os livros no GitHub ↗</a>';
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { min-height: 650px; padding: 104px 0 72px; overflow: hidden; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 72% 47%, rgba(37,95,204,.20), transparent 42%), linear-gradient(120deg, var(--bg) 18%, var(--bg-2) 100%); }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; gap: 36px; align-items: center; }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .live-dot { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--gold-soft); margin-right: 9px; }
  .hero-copy > p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.14rem; max-width: 590px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 29px; }
  .hero-metrics { display: flex; gap: 34px; margin-top: 61px; }
  .hero-metrics > div { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); padding-left: 18px; display: grid; line-height: 1.25; }
  .hero-metrics strong { font: 800 1.45rem 'Manrope', sans-serif; }
  .hero-metrics span { font-size: .78rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 5px; }
  .hero-visual { position: relative; height: 530px; display: grid; place-items: center; isolation: isolate; }
  .hero-visual::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 450px; height: 450px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(65,121,246,.18), transparent 66%); filter: blur(6px); }
  .orbit { position: absolute; border: 1px solid rgba(138,174,240,.25); border-radius: 50%; transform: rotate(-18deg); }
  .orbit-one { width: 315px; height: 315px; }
  .orbit-two { width: 435px; height: 435px; border-style: dashed; border-color: rgba(227,189,115,.23); }
  .orbit-three { width: 515px; height: 515px; border-color: rgba(138,174,240,.1); }
  .central-disc { position: relative; display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; width: 235px; height: 235px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1b4fa4, #0d2758 67%, #071938); border: 1px solid rgba(227,189,115,.45); box-shadow: 0 0 0 13px rgba(43,91,170,.15), 0 30px 80px rgba(0,8,26,.5), inset 0 0 45px rgba(95,157,249,.18); overflow: hidden; }
  .disc-grid { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: .27; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.12) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.12) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 26px 26px; transform: rotate(-24deg) scale(1.4); }
  .central-disc span { position: relative; font: 800 3.15rem 'Manrope', sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.08em; color: white; }
  .central-disc small { position: relative; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: .19em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .52rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .floating-tag { position: absolute; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; min-width: 174px; padding: 11px 15px; background: rgba(13,38,80,.95); color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(227,189,115,.26); border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,7,25,.25); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
  .floating-tag strong { display: block; font-size: .79rem; line-height: 1.2; }
  .floating-tag small { color: #a9bbd8; font-size: .67rem; }
  .tag-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(227,189,115,.13); color: #e3bd73; }
  .tag-one { left: 0; top: 110px; }.tag-two { right: -12px; top: 90px; }.tag-three { right: -10px; bottom: 86px; }
  .orbit-point { position: absolute; width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--gold); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--gold); }.p1{left: 18%; top: 30%;}.p2{right: 16%; top: 54%;}.p3{left: 24%; bottom: 17%;}.p4{right: 32%; bottom: 9%;}
  .start-section { background: var(--bg); }
  .routes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
  .route-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 31px; box-shadow: none; transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s; }
  .route-card:hover { border-color: rgba(227,189,115,.55); transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .route-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .route-number { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .15em; font-size: .9rem; }.route-shape { font-size: 1.65rem; color: var(--gold); }
  .route-card h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 16px 0 8px; }.route-card > p { color: var(--muted); min-height: 53px; margin-bottom: 17px; }
  .route-steps { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: var(--gold); font-size: .77rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .04em; margin-bottom: 27px; }
  .route-steps span:nth-child(even) { color: var(--muted); }
  .route-fields { display: grid; gap: 15px; flex: 1; }.route-note { align-self: start; background: var(--gold-soft); color: var(--muted); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 11px; padding: 13px 15px; font-size: .84rem; }
  .route-button { margin-top: 25px; width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; }
  .catalog-status { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; margin: 17px 0 0; }
  .philosophy { background: var(--bg-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .philosophy-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 9%; align-items: center; }
  .philosophy-grid > div:first-child > p { max-width: 540px; }.text-link { font-weight: 800; color: var(--gold); }
  .principles { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }.principles > div { display: flex; gap: 22px; padding: 21px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }.principles span { font: 800 .86rem 'Manrope', sans-serif; color: var(--gold); }.principles strong { font: 800 1rem 'Manrope', sans-serif; }.principles p { color: var(--muted); margin: 3px 0 0; font-size: .87rem; }
  .ai-strip { background: radial-gradient(circle at 88% 50%, rgba(47,99,206,.3), transparent 42%), var(--bg); }.ai-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; }.ai-inner > div { max-width: 700px; }.ai-inner p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 580px; }
  @media(max-width: 980px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-visual{height:450px;max-width:600px;margin:auto}.hero{padding-top:80px}.philosophy-grid{gap:5%}}
  @media(max-width: 700px){.hero{padding-top:66px}.hero-visual{height:380px;transform:scale(.72);margin:-35px auto -65px}.hero-metrics{gap:10px;margin-top:40px;justify-content:space-between}.hero-metrics>div{padding-left:10px}.routes,.philosophy-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.route-card{padding:24px}.ai-inner{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.section-head{margin-bottom:20px}}
</style>
